From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kuraka <kuraka@localhost>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 01:01:18 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix(livechat): do not ask returning visitors for their last
 name again

Kuraka-Severity: normal
Kuraka-Adds-En: Visitors who already chatted are not asked for their last name again when they start a new chat.
Kuraka-Adds-Es: Los visitantes que ya chatearon no vuelven a ver la pregunta del apellido al empezar un chat nuevo.
Kuraka-Missing-En: Visitors who already chatted are asked for their last name again on every new chat.
Kuraka-Missing-Es: Los visitantes que ya chatearon vuelven a ver la pregunta del apellido en cada chat nuevo.
---
 frontend/apps/widget/src/components/PreChatForm.vue | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/frontend/apps/widget/src/components/PreChatForm.vue b/frontend/apps/widget/src/components/PreChatForm.vue
index 7ba48c56..2f6dcbca 100644
--- a/frontend/apps/widget/src/components/PreChatForm.vue
+++ b/frontend/apps/widget/src/components/PreChatForm.vue
@@ -327,9 +327,9 @@ const formFields = computed(() => config.value.fields || [])
 const sortedFields = computed(() => {
   let fields = formFields.value.filter((field) => field.enabled)
 
-  // If user has session token, exclude default name, email and phone fields
+  // If user has session token, exclude default name, email and phone fields and Kuraka's last name
   if (props.excludeDefaultFields) {
-    fields = fields.filter((field) => !['name', 'email', 'phone'].includes(field.key))
+    fields = fields.filter((field) => !['name', 'last_name', 'email', 'phone'].includes(field.key))
   }
 
   return fields.sort((a, b) => (a.order || 0) - (b.order || 0))
